# armour/shared/pauldron_leaf5_l: the great LEAF pauldron on the left shoulder (leaf.5; ARMOUR-X, wave 2: PLAN "The envelope in production", STYLE_P2 29).
# leaf lames grown great: a leaf cop over three (legend four) leaf-shaped lames down the upper arm, each with a
# dark midrib, lit on its outer half and shaded on its inner half, the tips pointing down (SYLVAN; the DROP mass).
# 5 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (26 across with its pair; STYLE_P2 29.3). Side views wider and hanging lower.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: N the seams, P the lit halves, R the last leaf, G the glint.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by ARMOUR-X genx.py from shapesx.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron leaf.5
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys pauld
z 5
side L

